{"suttaId":"thig10.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Thī","vriCode":"s0509m.mul","paras":[802,836],"vripara":"213"},"segments":{"thig10.1:0.3":"Kisāgotamītherīgāthā","thig10.1:1.1":"“Kalyāṇamittatā muninā, lokaṃ ādissa vaṇṇitā;","thig10.1:1.3":"Kalyāṇamitte bhajamāno, api bālo paṇḍito assa.","thig10.1:2.1":"“Bhajitabbā sappurisā, paññā tathā vaḍḍhati bhajantānaṃ;","thig10.1:2.3":"Bhajamāno sappurise, sabbehipi dukkhehi pamucceyya.","thig10.1:3.1":"“Dukkhañca vijāneyya, dukkhassa ca samudayaṃ nirodhaṃ;","thig10.1:3.3":"Aṭṭhaṅgikañca maggaṃ, cattāripi ariyasaccāni.","thig10.1:4.1":"“Dukkho itthibhāvo, akkhāto purisadammasārathinā;","thig10.1:4.3":"Sapattikampi hi dukkhaṃ, appekaccā sakiṃ vijātāyo.","thig10.1:5.1":"“Galake api kantanti, sukhumāliniyo visāni khādanti;","thig10.1:5.3":"Janamārakamajjhagatā, ubhopi byasanāni anubhonti.","thig10.1:6.1":"“Upavijaññā gacchantī, addasāhaṃ patiṃ mataṃ;","thig10.1:6.3":"Panthamhi vijāyitvāna, appattāva sakaṃ gharaṃ.","thig10.1:7.1":"“Dve puttā kālakatā, patī ca panthe mato kapaṇikāya;","thig10.1:7.3":"Mātā pitā ca bhātā, ḍayhanti ca ekacitakāyaṃ.","thig10.1:8.1":"“Khīṇakulīne kapaṇe, anubhūtaṃ te dukhaṃ aparimāṇaṃ;","thig10.1:8.3":"Assū ca te pavattaṃ, bahūni ca jātisahassāni.","thig10.1:9.1":"“Vasitā susānamajjhe, athopi khāditāni puttamaṃsāni;","thig10.1:9.3":"Hatakulikā sabbagarahitā, matapatikā amatamadhigacchiṃ.","thig10.1:10.1":"“Bhāvito me maggo, ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko amatagāmī;","thig10.1:10.3":"Nibbānaṃ sacchikataṃ, dhammādāsaṃ avekkhiṃhaṃ [apekkhihaṃ (sī.)].","thig10.1:11.1":"“Ahamamhi kantasallā, ohitabhārā katañhi karaṇīyaṃ;","thig10.1:11.3":"Kisā gotamī therī, vimuttacittā imaṃ bhaṇī”ti.","thig10.1:12.1":"… Kisā gotamī therī ….","thig10.1:13.1":"Ekādasanipāto niṭṭhito."},"attha":{"book":"Thī-a","bookName":"Therīgāthā-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0509a.att","from":2866,"to":2866,"paras":[{"para":2866,"vripara":null,"refs":["thig10.1:11"],"lines":["<b>Ahamamhi kantasallā</b>ti ariyamaggena samucchinnagārādisallā ahaṃ amhi.","<b>Ohitabhārā</b>ti oropitakāmakhandhakilesābhisaṅkhārabhārā.","<b>Katañhi karaṇīyan</b>ti pariññādibhedaṃ soḷasavidhampi kiccaṃ kataṃ pariyositaṃ.","<b>Suvimuttacittā imaṃ bhaṇī</b>ti sabbaso vimuttacittā kisāgotamī therī imamatthaṃ “kalyāṇamittatā”tiādinā gāthābandhavasena abhaṇīti attānaṃ paraṃ viya therī vadati.","Tatridaṃ imissā theriyā <b>apadānaṃ</b> (apa. therī 2.3.55-94)–"],"lineRefs":[["thig10.1:11"],["thig10.1:11"],["thig10.1:11"],["thig10.1:11"],["thig10.1:11"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thig10.1:11.1","ahamamhi kantasallā",0,0],["thig10.1:11.1","ohitabhārā",0,1],["thig10.1:11.1","katañhi karaṇīyaṃ",0,2]]},"tika":null}
